        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Hi, love your work.\r\nI'll keep this short as @mehalter has already said most of everything, I'm one of those dumb asses that heavily need the \"are you sure you want to quit function\" i understand from your perspective it's a lot of work but from a UX point of view its a pretty big shock when you fumble your keys and delete all your stuff :)",
